React:
    -it is javascript library.
    -it is mainly used for creating rich user interface.
    -it create single page application(SPA).
    -it wrok on component basis.
    -react develop and maintain by meta(Facebook).
    -latest version of react is react-18.

   ?Note:Nodejs must be install for all on the below.
    **Three ways to create react project..
        -1. by using npm : need to install configuration file first.
                npm install -g create-react-app
                create-react-app projectname
                cd projectname
                npm start.
        -2. by using npx: no nedd to install configuration file.
                npx create-react-app projectname.
                cd projectname.
                npm start.
        -3. by using vite: it create react project with minimum requirement.


Q>How to get output of react project.
    -first we have to write 'npm start' command . then it will display react project output on browser with localhost:3000 port number.
    localhost is a server . for react it is provided by the nodejs

    